# The same refusal for a record with no chain to be part of. One `::` rule is a
# double-colon target as much as three are — `enter_file` reads the flag, not
# the length — and this is the shape whose graph has nothing to tell it apart
# from an ordinary rule, so the reading has to come from the record.
all: app
app: out
	touch app
out:: a
	touch out
